{'symbol': 'TXN', 'date': '2023-03-07 21:48:00', 'title': 'TEXAS INSTRUMENTS PRICES $1.4 BILLION OF INVESTMENT GRADE NOTES', 'text': 'DALLAS , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- (MARCH 7, 2023) – TEXAS INSTRUMENTS INCORPORATED (TI) (NASDAQ: TXN) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF TWO SERIES OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES FOR AN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $1.4 BILLION. THE NOTES CONSIST OF THE FOLLOWING: $750 MILLION OF 4.900% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE MARCH 14, 2033; AND $650 MILLION OF 5.000% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE MARCH 14, 2053.'}